WEBVTT

00:19.208 --> 00:21.041
Wakey-wakey, Twinkle Toes!

00:46.416 --> 00:49.916
BA SING SE WELCOMES THE AVATAR

01:16.791 --> 01:17.875
Sai.

03:02.208 --> 03:04.375
Smash time, Windbreaker!

03:12.083 --> 03:13.375
Sai!

03:20.291 --> 03:21.916
Up and at 'em, Bald Wonder!

03:34.583 --> 03:35.416
Sai!

03:40.833 --> 03:42.208
Let's go, Melonhead.

03:54.666 --> 03:55.583
You in there?

03:56.166 --> 03:57.000
Snorebender!

04:00.833 --> 04:02.000
Sai?

04:04.583 --> 04:05.666
Flight Risk!

04:10.541 --> 04:11.500
Boomerang!

04:15.250 --> 04:16.916
Bald Sing Sae!

04:20.750 --> 04:23.208
Are you… fighting me?

04:33.000 --> 04:35.166
Not bad for an Airbender.

05:02.750 --> 05:06.208
Fire Nation military amassing.
This is their rally point.

05:06.291 --> 05:10.416
-There's tank regiments now.
-We need to warn Ba Sing Se. Should I go?

05:13.458 --> 05:15.166
No. I'll go.

05:25.250 --> 05:26.416
Remember us?

05:56.500 --> 05:59.833
Don't you know that fans
just make flames stronger?

06:10.916 --> 06:12.250
You're pretty strong.

06:13.000 --> 06:13.833
True.

06:13.916 --> 06:16.166
You're good at bending things
that are close to you.

06:17.583 --> 06:19.833
-Very true.
-But you're not subtle.

06:20.416 --> 06:22.750
Sometimes you need to bend things
that are far away.

06:25.083 --> 06:26.291
Like this?

06:30.375 --> 06:32.583
More like this.

06:38.291 --> 06:39.416
Like what?

06:39.500 --> 06:42.041
I knocked a date away from Sokka
with a tiny stone pillar.

06:42.125 --> 06:43.458
-Really?
-Now you try.

06:43.541 --> 06:46.000
-How can I bend something I can't see?
-Whoa!

06:46.083 --> 06:47.125
No, I didn't. I--

06:47.208 --> 06:48.208
Don't apologize.

06:48.833 --> 06:51.875
But your problem
is now suddenly very obvious.

06:53.625 --> 06:54.500
Put this on.

06:56.500 --> 06:59.916
Now you have to see
beyond what you can see.

07:00.000 --> 07:00.833
Huh?

07:00.916 --> 07:03.125
I can tell that whatever is
in front of your eyes

07:03.208 --> 07:05.458
is a big distraction for you.

07:05.541 --> 07:08.458
Try and bend up a wall behind you.

07:14.541 --> 07:16.458
No, okay, no. No.

07:17.250 --> 07:18.166
Okay.

07:18.958 --> 07:20.583
Remember when we first met,

07:20.666 --> 07:23.791
how I told you
that everything is vibrating?

07:25.000 --> 07:26.875
This is what I mean.

07:28.083 --> 07:31.791
There's… a secret life of the world

07:31.875 --> 07:33.375
that you need to feel.

07:34.291 --> 07:36.166
A life beneath the sand.

07:36.250 --> 07:37.583
Beneath the rock.

07:37.666 --> 07:40.208
Beneath everything you think you know.

07:40.750 --> 07:41.791
Real life.

07:43.208 --> 07:44.375
If you can feel it,

07:45.208 --> 07:46.583
then you can change it.

07:58.250 --> 08:01.041
Now bend a tiny pillar up on that porch.

08:01.875 --> 08:02.750
Okay.

08:14.583 --> 08:15.750
Did I do it?

08:25.625 --> 08:28.541
That must be Long Feng.
I gotta go. See ya.

08:41.000 --> 08:42.416
How's your new job?

08:43.333 --> 08:44.208
Hmm.

08:49.875 --> 08:51.166
This is cold.

08:56.666 --> 08:59.208
Where are the… where are the spark rocks?

08:59.291 --> 09:00.791
When did we get this?

09:01.750 --> 09:04.208
-It looks expensive.
-We needed a new one.

09:21.333 --> 09:24.583
It's wonderful to see
the impact you have had on the city.

09:26.208 --> 09:27.583
It's been nice.

09:28.083 --> 09:30.916
I didn't really know
being the Avatar could be like this.

09:31.458 --> 09:32.958
It is how it should be.

09:36.041 --> 09:36.916
What's wrong?

09:37.916 --> 09:40.583
-You know about earthbending.
-Yes.

09:41.208 --> 09:44.583
I used to be, uh… quite good myself.

09:46.250 --> 09:51.250
Do you know about how everything is
vibrating in the secret life to the world?

09:51.333 --> 09:52.791
Or something.

09:53.916 --> 09:55.375
Mm-mm.

09:57.166 --> 10:00.041
Toph was telling me, if I focus,

10:00.125 --> 10:03.833
I should be able to feel
what's happening underneath.

10:04.333 --> 10:05.541
The real world.

10:05.625 --> 10:08.000
But I can't seem to get it.

10:10.208 --> 10:12.750
You have a unique nature, Aang.

10:13.666 --> 10:16.208
It's something
that is apparent right away.

10:17.291 --> 10:19.708
You see the good in everyone.

10:19.791 --> 10:23.250
And because you see that goodness,
you can bring it out of people.

10:24.250 --> 10:28.458
Now, I don't pretend
to be an earthbending master,

10:28.541 --> 10:31.666
but it sounds like
what you're trying to do

10:31.750 --> 10:34.375
is distrust the way you see the world.

10:37.500 --> 10:38.833
If you ask me,

10:39.333 --> 10:43.875
I think you should trust your heart.

10:46.833 --> 10:48.916
At least that's how I try to live.

10:49.958 --> 10:51.208
Maybe that's naive?

10:53.750 --> 10:54.708
No.

10:56.333 --> 10:57.875
I think that's what I believe too.

11:26.333 --> 11:28.166
Well, well, well…

11:30.083 --> 11:31.458
Isn't this quaint?

11:32.333 --> 11:35.000
-Professor, how'd it go?
-Well, this is all I could find.

11:35.083 --> 11:36.041
Hey.

11:36.125 --> 11:39.750
Unfortunately,
the university library is terrible.

11:41.750 --> 11:44.541
Is that food just… for anyone?

11:44.625 --> 11:46.166
Oh, yeah, help yourself.

11:47.000 --> 11:49.416
Uh, so what's the problem
with the library?

11:49.500 --> 11:50.708
It's a disaster.

11:50.791 --> 11:54.541
Hundreds of tomes have been stolen
or censored over the years.

11:54.625 --> 11:57.500
-Why would someone steal books?
-Well, knowledge is power.

11:57.583 --> 12:01.458
And power must remain
in the hands of those who fear losing it.

12:01.958 --> 12:06.000
I, of course, believe that knowledge,
for the sake of knowledge itself,

12:06.708 --> 12:08.958
is the purest human pursuit.

12:09.041 --> 12:12.208
It's why I've been searching
for the lost library of the spirits.

12:12.291 --> 12:13.791
Wait, the spirits have a library?

12:14.500 --> 12:17.166
It used to just be outside Ba Sing Se,

12:17.833 --> 12:19.958
but it vanished a hundred years ago.

12:22.125 --> 12:27.166
I would give anything
for a single day to peruse its contents.

12:29.875 --> 12:31.250
Is this mango?

12:32.833 --> 12:35.541
Oh, that one should have
the schematics for a telescope. Yeah.

12:35.625 --> 12:38.708
You must know
all about celestial navigation,

12:38.791 --> 12:40.500
being a seafaring people.

12:40.583 --> 12:42.666
Yeah. Uh, well, this isn't for sailing.

12:42.750 --> 12:43.833
It's for

12:45.291 --> 12:46.583
Avatar purposes.

12:46.666 --> 12:47.500
Oh.

12:47.583 --> 12:49.541
We had a telescope. Or

12:50.458 --> 12:51.541
my friend did.

12:52.750 --> 12:54.000
He's missing.

12:54.083 --> 12:56.958
So I'm gonna try to make my own.

12:58.541 --> 13:01.791
Your friend. How long has he been missing?

13:01.875 --> 13:03.875
Weeks, almost since we got here.

13:05.916 --> 13:06.916
Why?

13:11.000 --> 13:13.500
It's not only books
that go missing in the city.

13:14.000 --> 13:17.750
Over the years,
teachers who asked the wrong questions

13:17.833 --> 13:20.916
or students who tried to organize protests

13:21.000 --> 13:22.875
would suddenly vanish.

13:22.958 --> 13:24.166
Taken.

13:25.166 --> 13:26.208
Taken by who?

13:29.666 --> 13:31.166
I shouldn't have said anything.

13:31.250 --> 13:32.583
Uh…

13:33.500 --> 13:34.791
Uh…

13:34.875 --> 13:38.166
Professor, wait. Our… our friend
is key to our mission here.

13:38.250 --> 13:40.083
He's a man of learning, like us.

13:46.166 --> 13:49.750
If your friend was taken,
all of you could be in danger…

13:51.750 --> 13:52.833
from the Dai Li.

13:52.916 --> 13:54.541
The king's guard?

13:55.416 --> 13:57.041
But why would they take Sai?

13:57.125 --> 13:58.208
Did he know something

13:58.291 --> 14:02.166
that might be a threat
to the Earth King's rule over Ba Sing Se?

14:11.708 --> 14:12.666
Enjoy.

14:15.333 --> 14:17.541
Excuse me. Is Mushi here?

14:17.625 --> 14:20.041
No. He took a break.

14:21.000 --> 14:22.541
I think he went to the market.

14:25.333 --> 14:26.708
You're the nephew.

14:27.833 --> 14:28.708
Aren't you?

14:31.000 --> 14:31.916
Yeah.

14:32.708 --> 14:34.541
He's really sweet, you know.

14:34.625 --> 14:37.500
We all call him Uncle.
Though he's pretty shy.

14:38.500 --> 14:39.541
Shy?

14:43.250 --> 14:44.708
Do you know when he'll be back?

14:44.791 --> 14:47.375
No. You wanna come in and wait for him?

14:48.208 --> 14:51.291
Or are you shy too?

14:52.958 --> 14:55.625
No. I'll see him at home. Thanks.

15:04.250 --> 15:05.250
Hey.

15:05.333 --> 15:08.708
Lee, right?
I was wondering when I'd run into you.

15:09.625 --> 15:12.333
Don't you look miserable?
Working stiff, I see.

15:13.083 --> 15:14.083
Hey.

15:14.916 --> 15:17.833
You know, we made a great team
back there on the ferry.

15:17.916 --> 15:20.333
And I got a little something going on
for myself here.

15:20.416 --> 15:23.833
If you're interested,
maybe we can help each other out?

15:24.541 --> 15:25.500
No, thanks.

15:26.083 --> 15:27.791
Come on. It'll be fun.

15:27.875 --> 15:30.375
It's payback for that restaurant
that got torched.

15:30.458 --> 15:32.083
Who do people think did it?

15:34.000 --> 15:34.958
It was a fire.

15:35.041 --> 15:37.875
Obviously, it was the lowlifes
from the Fire Nation district.

15:37.958 --> 15:38.916
The what?

15:41.333 --> 15:42.291
You don't know?

15:44.500 --> 15:47.000
There's a group
of reformed Fire Nation people

15:47.083 --> 15:49.541
living in the old stables across the park.

15:49.625 --> 15:51.666
They're not supposed to firebend
or make trouble,

15:51.750 --> 15:54.041
but trouble's in their blood.

15:54.833 --> 15:58.291
A group of concerned citizens are
going there tonight to discuss the matter.

15:58.375 --> 16:03.083
If some… light rioting
or looting breaks out…

16:04.625 --> 16:05.583
You want in?

16:07.125 --> 16:09.083
I could use someone to watch my back.

16:12.375 --> 16:13.666
What about your friends?

16:17.625 --> 16:18.750
I'm done with them.

16:19.708 --> 16:21.708
Yeah, they don't see the world
the way that we do.

16:25.833 --> 16:27.041
Meet me at sundown.

16:28.416 --> 16:29.416
It'll be fun.

16:34.958 --> 16:36.916
What about these? I would like…

17:01.291 --> 17:06.375
The Fire Nation army ravaged this city
when they broke down our wall!

17:06.958 --> 17:11.166
Never forget what those demons did
to our parents,

17:11.250 --> 17:13.208
our families,

17:13.833 --> 17:15.583
to all of us!

17:16.666 --> 17:18.458
Remember their names.

17:36.125 --> 17:39.708
BLOOD FROM A STONE. REMEMBER.

18:00.833 --> 18:02.375
Never forget the siege.

18:02.458 --> 18:03.708
Stop right there!

18:04.708 --> 18:06.750
Never forget our dead!

18:16.208 --> 18:18.500
Nothing to see here! Get going!

18:19.125 --> 18:20.041
Leave!

18:20.625 --> 18:21.583
Now!

18:37.833 --> 18:39.208
Princess Azula is coming.

18:39.291 --> 18:41.041
What? When?

18:46.416 --> 18:48.708
-My princess.
-Your perimeter is compromised.

18:48.791 --> 18:52.041
We apprehended spies who could've
reported your movements to Ba Sing Se

18:52.125 --> 18:53.958
and warned the city about the attack.

18:54.041 --> 18:57.333
We will tighten the perimeter at once,
but I must inform you

18:58.708 --> 19:00.250
the attack has been postponed.

19:02.291 --> 19:03.333
Until when?

19:03.416 --> 19:04.333
Indefinitely.

19:04.416 --> 19:07.083
Orders arrived this morning
from the Fire Lord himself.

19:08.208 --> 19:09.583
What reason did he give?

19:09.666 --> 19:12.250
He said the timing was unfavorable.

19:21.041 --> 19:21.875
He

19:22.625 --> 19:23.833
gave no reason.

19:25.125 --> 19:27.958
Don't lie to me again.
I don't have time for this.

19:28.041 --> 19:31.291
My brother is in that city.
I was counting on the attack

19:31.375 --> 19:33.958
to give us cover to get in
and hunt him down.

19:34.041 --> 19:35.583
You could order the attack anyway.

19:36.625 --> 19:38.125
I'd bet he'd do anything for you.

19:38.833 --> 19:41.541
There must be some message
your father's trying to send you.

19:43.583 --> 19:46.541
You're right.
He approved the plan as his endorsement.

19:46.625 --> 19:48.708
He wouldn't then call it off unless…

19:51.875 --> 19:53.375
he thinks there's a better plan.

19:53.458 --> 19:55.375
He told you your mission

19:56.291 --> 19:58.208
was more important than the attack.

19:59.750 --> 20:02.000
I've been thinking about this a lot, and

20:02.500 --> 20:06.583
it's really weird
that he was put in charge of your attack

20:06.666 --> 20:08.208
when you're the smartest one here.

20:08.291 --> 20:09.541
You're right, Ty Lee.

20:10.500 --> 20:12.708
That was really weird, wasn't it?

20:14.000 --> 20:16.041
My plan.

20:16.125 --> 20:17.666
My attack.

20:18.541 --> 20:19.750
My mission.

20:28.541 --> 20:30.875
-You're loyal.
-Yes, Princess.

20:31.500 --> 20:32.833
Devoted.

20:32.916 --> 20:34.250
Yes, Princess.

20:34.333 --> 20:36.500
You would do anything I order you to do.

20:38.875 --> 20:39.958
Anything,

20:40.541 --> 20:41.625
Princess.

20:43.083 --> 20:44.000
Good.

20:52.000 --> 20:53.833
What?

20:54.791 --> 20:56.416
-Moon peach wine.
-Oh.

20:56.500 --> 20:59.708
Just another bribe
someone left with a marriage proposal.

21:00.500 --> 21:02.291
Oh.

21:02.791 --> 21:03.875
Weird.

21:15.458 --> 21:16.625
What are you doing?

21:17.833 --> 21:18.916
What?

21:26.916 --> 21:28.125
Okay, what is that?

21:28.208 --> 21:29.958
Oh, I'm sorry.

21:30.041 --> 21:33.250
Is my tea drinking disturbing you
while you're trying to eat?

21:36.000 --> 21:37.416
Yeah, a little.

21:37.500 --> 21:38.708
You know, it's kind of funny.

21:38.791 --> 21:42.375
Because last night,
and every night for a while now,

21:42.458 --> 21:44.708
I have been sound asleep

21:44.791 --> 21:47.291
and then clonk, clonk, clonk.

21:47.375 --> 21:50.000
I hear someone's big old feet
clomping through the house

21:50.083 --> 21:51.291
and out the door.

21:51.375 --> 21:54.000
Okay. I'm not hurting anyone.

21:54.083 --> 21:56.916
In fact, I'm actually helping--
Will you stop that?

21:57.000 --> 22:00.958
Look, I don't need to know
what you're doing or why.

22:01.041 --> 22:03.250
Why would you tell me
you knew I was sneaking out

22:03.333 --> 22:05.083
if you didn't wanna know why?

22:05.166 --> 22:07.791
Because Aang is getting pretty good
at earthbending,

22:07.875 --> 22:12.541
and soon, he's gonna be able
to feel these things the way I do.

22:13.041 --> 22:14.375
So then he'll know.

22:14.875 --> 22:16.041
Right.

22:16.666 --> 22:18.375
And you know how he is about you.

22:20.583 --> 22:21.583
What?

22:23.625 --> 22:26.750
You know, how he acts when you're around,

22:26.833 --> 22:29.166
and he thinks you're…

22:31.458 --> 22:32.541
His friend?

22:34.708 --> 22:35.541
Yeah.

22:36.291 --> 22:38.250
That's… that's what I meant.
That friendship.

22:38.333 --> 22:42.291
It's so… strong. That's definitely why
I said all those words.

22:42.375 --> 22:43.791
Toph, are you--

22:45.375 --> 22:48.375
You know, that is…
That's probably for me anyway.

22:48.458 --> 22:50.833
So I'm just gonna, uh…

22:50.916 --> 22:53.791
Oh, yeah, uh-huh. Okay. Uh, see ya!

23:01.833 --> 23:02.916
Oh.

23:03.000 --> 23:03.875
Hi there.

23:04.583 --> 23:08.125
Hello, Miss Beifong.
I'm enthralled to make your acquaintance.

23:08.208 --> 23:10.458
Lau Wong. At your service.

23:10.541 --> 23:12.000
Yeah, yeah. Nice to meet you too.

23:12.083 --> 23:14.333
I have a proposal for you.

23:14.416 --> 23:16.791
You sound a little old
to be proposing to someone like me.

23:16.875 --> 23:18.458
No, no, no.

23:18.541 --> 23:21.916
Uh, my proposal
is of a more delicate nature.

23:22.000 --> 23:24.250
It has to do with your parents' business.

23:24.333 --> 23:25.291
Oh, yeah.

23:25.375 --> 23:28.958
Not involved in that, friendo,
but you can shoot your shot if you want.

23:29.833 --> 23:33.000
As I said, this is delicate.

23:33.083 --> 23:35.583
I think we should remove ourselves
from any prying ears.

23:35.666 --> 23:37.750
No way. You've gotta be, like,

23:37.833 --> 23:40.375
the shadiest person
I've met in the city so far.

23:40.458 --> 23:42.541
I'm definitely not following you
to a second location.

23:42.625 --> 23:44.166
If you don't hear me out,

23:44.250 --> 23:47.208
I'll send my information
straight to the authorities.

23:49.916 --> 23:52.833
I can assure you that what I know
will be damaging beyond repair

23:52.916 --> 23:55.750
to the Avatar's good standing.

24:03.041 --> 24:05.250
So, you believe Professor Zei?

24:05.333 --> 24:06.875
You think Sai was taken?

24:06.958 --> 24:09.333
It makes sense why
he hasn't responded of my messages.

24:15.500 --> 24:17.041
I need to get a look inside.

24:18.750 --> 24:20.083
I'll have to pick the lock.

24:22.833 --> 24:24.708
The messages I left him are gone.

24:28.791 --> 24:30.458
And all of his things.

24:30.541 --> 24:32.791
Sai? Sai?

24:33.625 --> 24:36.208
Oh, I thought Sai was finally back.

24:36.291 --> 24:37.833
What do you mean "finally"?

24:37.916 --> 24:40.375
I haven't seen him
since our first night in Ba Sing Se.

24:41.000 --> 24:43.291
I sent messages to Katara,
asking for help.

24:43.375 --> 24:45.416
-Didn't you guys get them?
-No.

24:46.166 --> 24:47.250
We didn't.

24:47.750 --> 24:50.583
What… is all this?

24:51.416 --> 24:52.625
We found it like this.

24:52.708 --> 24:54.958
You must inform me of your movements

24:55.041 --> 24:57.500
so that I can assist you
as you navigate the city.

24:58.000 --> 25:00.750
There could be serious consequences
for activities like this.

25:00.833 --> 25:04.166
Joo Dee, our friend Sai lives here,
and he's missing.

25:04.875 --> 25:06.791
Of course he's not missing.

25:07.291 --> 25:10.083
He's been employed
in a highly coveted position

25:10.166 --> 25:12.500
with the Ba Sing Se Royal Engineers.

25:12.583 --> 25:15.708
Their work is of incredible value,
so they're housed in the palace.

25:15.791 --> 25:17.083
But no one's heard from him.

25:17.166 --> 25:18.750
I'll look in on him at the palace

25:18.833 --> 25:21.208
and tell him
you inquired about him, Amita.

25:23.958 --> 25:26.041
You see, everything is fine.

25:44.125 --> 25:45.083
Catch.

25:48.958 --> 25:49.791
Who are you?

25:51.791 --> 25:53.041
Are you Fire Nation?

25:53.958 --> 25:55.916
We are true Fire Nation.

25:58.000 --> 25:59.458
Then what are you doing here?

26:00.041 --> 26:02.166
-Living free.
-Free?

26:03.250 --> 26:05.541
Your whole neighborhood's fenced in.
It's filthy.

26:05.625 --> 26:08.708
We are free
from the warmongering tyranny of Ozai.

26:08.791 --> 26:10.583
You mean Fire Lord Ozai.

26:10.666 --> 26:12.958
He is not my Fire Lord.

26:13.458 --> 26:19.333
I would rather live a hundred years
as the filth of the Earth Kingdom

26:19.416 --> 26:23.041
than spend one more day
under the command of that despot.

26:27.208 --> 26:29.916
What difference does it make to you
how we live?

26:33.375 --> 26:36.166
I just came here to warn you.

26:36.875 --> 26:38.125
There was a fire.

26:39.458 --> 26:42.958
It was an accident, but some men are
coming here tonight to blame you for it.

26:43.041 --> 26:44.333
An accident?

26:48.250 --> 26:51.166
I'm sure you know nothing about it.

26:51.666 --> 26:56.083
I saw how you caught that piece of fruit.
Blazing ring form.

26:57.375 --> 27:02.250
You may have cut your hair,
but you can't cut the fire from your soul.

27:03.083 --> 27:04.500
Just be ready for them.

27:04.583 --> 27:05.708
How?

27:07.333 --> 27:08.875
We're not allowed to bend.

27:09.375 --> 27:11.208
It's a condition of our asylum.

27:11.291 --> 27:14.125
You were the one who chose to live here.

27:16.375 --> 27:19.833
This isn't the first time I've been asked
to fight someone else's battles.

27:22.166 --> 27:26.041
Maybe you can hide, or…
take everyone out of here for the night.

27:26.125 --> 27:28.458
-I don't know.
-We've been warned.

27:29.125 --> 27:30.625
You've done your job.

27:30.708 --> 27:33.000
Now do yourself a favor, boy.

27:33.083 --> 27:34.708
Don't come back here.

27:39.250 --> 27:42.458
Only a fool seeks his own destruction.

27:53.083 --> 27:54.333
I have news for you.

27:54.416 --> 27:57.916
I was able to confirm
that your friend, Sai,

27:58.000 --> 27:59.791
was brought to the palace.

28:00.291 --> 28:02.041
-He was?
-It isn't good.

28:02.125 --> 28:05.166
He was brought in by the Dai Li,
not the Royal Engineers.

28:05.666 --> 28:07.416
He was questioned.

28:07.500 --> 28:08.875
Questioned about what?

28:08.958 --> 28:10.416
-The comet?
-No.

28:11.500 --> 28:15.125
Some nonsense
about him being a Fire Nation spy.

28:18.333 --> 28:19.458
Okay.

28:19.541 --> 28:22.500
Technically, he was a spy back in Omashu.

28:22.583 --> 28:24.625
But he was doing it to keep the city safe.

28:24.708 --> 28:26.625
They say he tried to kill the king.

28:26.708 --> 28:28.916
Not on purpose. And Bumi was fine.

28:29.000 --> 28:31.375
That is not good, Aang.

28:31.458 --> 28:35.291
It may have set us back
in our efforts to see the king.

28:40.166 --> 28:41.250
There's something else.

28:41.833 --> 28:44.041
I think someone's been following me.

28:44.958 --> 28:46.416
-The Dai Li?
-I don't know.

28:46.500 --> 28:48.041
I'm not sure what to do about it.

28:51.041 --> 28:52.875
Do nothing.

28:52.958 --> 28:54.541
If they're keeping an eye on you,

28:54.625 --> 28:57.208
it's just to make sure
you're not a threat.

28:57.291 --> 28:59.625
As long as you keep out of trouble,

29:00.291 --> 29:04.333
the Dai Li will see that you're worthy
of an audience with the king.

29:06.166 --> 29:08.625
Stay out of trouble. That's his advice?

29:08.708 --> 29:12.166
I don't like any of this. Without Sai,
I'm gonna have to build a telescope.

29:12.250 --> 29:13.250
Look at this.

29:15.458 --> 29:17.125
I have no idea what I'm doing.

29:17.625 --> 29:20.625
Why didn't you tell us
that someone was following you?

29:20.708 --> 29:22.375
Sokka tried to tell you
something was wrong,

29:22.458 --> 29:25.000
but you didn't believe it
until Long Feng said it.

29:25.625 --> 29:28.750
I trust Long Feng. He's been helping us.

29:28.833 --> 29:30.541
It's the first time since Gyatso

29:30.625 --> 29:34.666
I actually feel like someone understands
the pressure that I'm under.

29:34.750 --> 29:37.666
We understand.
We've been doing this with you.

29:37.750 --> 29:38.833
You have?

29:38.916 --> 29:41.791
'Cause it feels like you've been sleeping
since we got here.

29:41.875 --> 29:43.291
I haven't seen you in days.

29:43.375 --> 29:46.250
Look, we know
you like being the Avatar here,

29:46.333 --> 29:48.458
meeting people, and making people smile--

29:48.541 --> 29:50.625
No, it's… it's not just that.

29:50.708 --> 29:53.791
I've been training with Toph
every single day.

29:53.875 --> 29:56.250
Do you guys want me
to master all four elements

29:56.333 --> 29:58.500
and save the world, stop the war,
don't you?

29:58.583 --> 30:00.291
So what's the problem?

30:00.375 --> 30:05.000
The problem is… it seems like you trust
Long Feng more than you trust us.

30:06.916 --> 30:08.625
Do you even have to think about that?

30:10.166 --> 30:11.416
Of course

30:12.166 --> 30:14.083
I trust you guys more.

30:15.291 --> 30:16.125
Okay.

30:20.208 --> 30:21.125
What do we do?

30:21.625 --> 30:24.333
Well, this might come as a shock,
but I actually have a plan.

30:24.416 --> 30:27.333
Whoever's following you
is definitely Dai Li, right?

30:27.416 --> 30:29.083
So, next time you see them,

30:29.166 --> 30:31.708
you use your airbending wiles
and follow them.

30:31.791 --> 30:33.750
Then you can follow them
to Dai Li headquarters,

30:33.833 --> 30:35.291
and maybe we can find Sai there.

30:35.375 --> 30:37.500
You're right. We need intelligence.

30:37.583 --> 30:39.458
-Sokka most of all.
-Yeah, wait.

30:42.000 --> 30:44.875
Your parents truly are brilliant people.

30:44.958 --> 30:48.208
Born at the top, stayed at the top.
Doesn't really take a genius.

30:48.291 --> 30:49.125
Mmm.

30:49.208 --> 30:51.583
But you don't know
what the war has been like for business.

30:52.375 --> 30:53.833
They've adapted.

30:53.916 --> 30:58.750
The Beifong Empire consists of
hundreds of smaller companies,

30:58.833 --> 31:01.750
whose connection to your parents is, mmm,

31:01.833 --> 31:06.541
obscured by many layers
of financial mumbo jumbo.

31:06.625 --> 31:09.958
Mmm! Well, you do strike me
as an expert on mumbo jumbo.

31:12.083 --> 31:14.166
You are charmingly direct.

31:14.666 --> 31:17.208
So I will be direct with you.

31:18.208 --> 31:22.041
I have some documents that prove
that several of these companies

31:22.125 --> 31:23.916
have lucrative contracts

31:24.000 --> 31:27.958
selling pistons, gears,
sheet metal, and more

31:28.041 --> 31:31.041
to a military factory in Jang Hui.

31:32.333 --> 31:34.500
A Fire Nation factory.

31:40.833 --> 31:45.041
My parents always say,
"Business knows no borders."

31:45.125 --> 31:49.708
Yes. Well, I think
the Earth King might feel differently.

31:50.625 --> 31:53.166
There may be no war in Ba Sing Se,

31:53.250 --> 31:55.333
but treason…

31:55.416 --> 31:57.000
…is fair game.

31:59.000 --> 32:00.416
There's a market up ahead.

32:00.916 --> 32:02.416
You know your way around here?

32:03.875 --> 32:06.083
I've been spending time down here.

32:06.791 --> 32:08.208
So that's where you've been.

32:09.666 --> 32:10.583
Yeah.

32:11.375 --> 32:14.291
You were earthbending.
It's not like you needed me for anything.

32:14.375 --> 32:15.500
And I'm here now, right?

32:16.416 --> 32:20.333
-Yeah, I guess.
-Aang, what's your problem?

32:21.875 --> 32:23.125
Katara,

32:24.666 --> 32:25.875
don't say anything.

32:26.750 --> 32:27.750
Okay.

32:34.958 --> 32:38.291
The spy is behind me in a hat.

32:40.458 --> 32:41.333
Right.

32:42.833 --> 32:44.208
I'll distract Joo Dee.

32:44.291 --> 32:46.541
Good idea. Act normal.

32:47.250 --> 32:48.083
Normal.

32:49.166 --> 32:50.291
Oh, Joo Dee.

32:50.375 --> 32:54.791
We were hoping you might help us
with a little shopping.

32:56.375 --> 32:57.416
As a matter of fact,

32:57.500 --> 33:01.375
I am an expert in the commerce
of the Lower Ring. If you'll follow me.

33:02.250 --> 33:04.250
That would be so helpful.

33:04.333 --> 33:06.666
What we really need is--

33:06.750 --> 33:09.791
Cabbages! Fresh cabbages for sale!

33:10.541 --> 33:11.750
Cabbages.

33:15.541 --> 33:18.208
No charge for you. Of course.

33:18.833 --> 33:21.291
We have much more refined delicacies
in the Upper Ring.

33:21.375 --> 33:23.708
-Oh.
-I just need a few fresh ones.

33:23.791 --> 33:25.041
They're all fresh.

33:25.125 --> 33:26.458
And round.

33:26.541 --> 33:28.625
The roundest in Ba Sing Se.

33:30.500 --> 33:31.666
Very well.

33:31.750 --> 33:35.333
Wonderful. You won't regret it.

33:35.416 --> 33:37.333
Uh, you want the round one?

33:37.416 --> 33:41.291
Cabbages are actually quite elegant.
Each of them are special.

33:41.375 --> 33:42.958
They have their own personalities.

33:49.125 --> 33:50.250
Hear that?

33:50.333 --> 33:51.375
Divinity.

33:51.875 --> 33:53.666
This will suffice.

33:54.250 --> 33:55.541
Katara. Aang…

33:58.958 --> 33:59.791
Katara?

34:00.375 --> 34:02.166
Oh! Wait…

34:02.250 --> 34:04.416
-Avatar!
-Hey.

34:04.500 --> 34:06.208
-Katara!
-But…

34:07.166 --> 34:09.500
My cabbages!

34:14.208 --> 34:15.666
It's happening tonight.

34:15.750 --> 34:17.166
The old stables.

34:17.250 --> 34:19.041
-We're gonna make them pay.
-Yes.

34:19.125 --> 34:20.916
And not just the ones who did it.

34:21.000 --> 34:24.250
Harbor a fugitive, bleed for a fugitive.

34:24.333 --> 34:26.166
We're gonna get revenge.

34:26.666 --> 34:27.916
For your family.

34:28.416 --> 34:29.833
For your friends.

34:30.333 --> 34:31.458
All of you.

34:59.666 --> 35:00.958
Avatar, wait!

35:32.166 --> 35:33.333
What is she doing?

35:36.166 --> 35:37.500
Oh, not you. I meant my friend.

35:38.458 --> 35:40.750
Sorry. Excuse me.

35:52.125 --> 35:54.250
We welcome this eve

35:54.333 --> 35:57.375
to our stage of well-worn boards

35:57.458 --> 35:59.416
a flower called Ting.

36:07.291 --> 36:09.583
Through all the long night

36:09.666 --> 36:12.916
Winter moon glows with bright love

36:13.416 --> 36:16.041
Sleet her silver tears

36:16.125 --> 36:17.416
Oh!

36:17.958 --> 36:19.833
Wonderful. Wonderful.

36:21.666 --> 36:22.916
Cascading water…

36:23.000 --> 36:26.541
Ow. Yeah, you caught me.
Here I am at a poetry class.

36:26.625 --> 36:29.833
-Toph, what were you doing up there?
-It's none of your business.

36:29.916 --> 36:32.583
Of course it's my business.
Mysterious stuff is happening in the city.

36:32.666 --> 36:34.583
And from what I just saw,
you might be part of it.

36:34.666 --> 36:36.625
-I'm not!
-I don't believe you!

36:36.708 --> 36:39.208
Five, seven, then five

36:39.291 --> 36:41.583
Syllables mark a haiku

36:41.666 --> 36:43.250
Remarkable oaf

36:45.375 --> 36:47.416
Oh, I'm no poet.

36:47.500 --> 36:49.916
Just a humble warrior
worried for my friend.

36:51.833 --> 36:52.708
Oh.

36:59.333 --> 37:01.166
Oh, hey, Toph? Hey, Toph?

37:04.500 --> 37:06.125
He wades in water

37:06.208 --> 37:08.083
Too warm for a floe of ice

37:08.583 --> 37:10.791
Turn around or melt

37:15.083 --> 37:19.541
I can't turn around

37:20.250 --> 37:24.958
I can withstand any heat

37:26.208 --> 37:28.333
If it's for my team

37:28.416 --> 37:29.791
Ooh!

37:32.541 --> 37:35.458
-Thank you.
-Bending is the team

37:36.083 --> 37:38.833
Water, earth, air, and fire

37:39.416 --> 37:40.833
You contribute none

37:41.375 --> 37:42.750
Oh!

37:45.875 --> 37:48.500
I was born this way

37:49.000 --> 37:50.000
A

37:51.291 --> 37:53.291
burden I have to bear

37:54.500 --> 37:56.166
You should understand

37:59.458 --> 38:01.291
Winter calls spring friend

38:01.375 --> 38:03.625
But it longs to frost flowers

38:04.333 --> 38:06.333
Blind is no burden

38:06.416 --> 38:07.416
No!

38:08.208 --> 38:09.958
Blind is your strength

38:10.041 --> 38:11.333
Born

38:12.916 --> 38:16.916
with wealth is a burden

38:17.500 --> 38:18.666
I do understand

38:26.208 --> 38:27.791
Inquisitive bird

38:28.333 --> 38:31.041
Caves hold secrets that aren't yours

38:31.541 --> 38:33.166
Stay in the clear skies

38:34.666 --> 38:37.250
In any season, I'm as solid as steel

38:37.958 --> 38:39.375
I can keep secrets

38:42.083 --> 38:44.250
A mountain may ask

38:44.333 --> 38:46.541
What keeps the night sky awake

38:47.875 --> 38:49.166
Does it even care?

38:49.250 --> 38:50.541
Yes!

38:50.625 --> 38:52.666
I care about my friends
I care about you

38:53.250 --> 38:54.666
And you are one

38:55.625 --> 38:57.833
Oh man. How many syllables am I on?
Was that…

38:57.916 --> 38:59.000
Oh!

39:00.250 --> 39:02.375
Oh, okay. Okay.

39:03.458 --> 39:05.041
Okay.

39:05.125 --> 39:07.000
Not bad for your first time.

39:08.166 --> 39:10.750
Honestly, I don't have any idea
how I was able to go on that long.

39:12.458 --> 39:15.625
Well, it was nice what you said.

39:18.166 --> 39:19.208
If we really are friends,

39:19.291 --> 39:20.958
you don't have to tell me
what was going on.

39:22.875 --> 39:23.875
I trust you.

39:25.458 --> 39:26.750
Um, okay.

39:27.916 --> 39:31.333
That guy was blackmailing me.
I bought proof from him

39:31.416 --> 39:34.041
that my parents are selling weapons
to the Fire Nation.

39:36.250 --> 39:38.958
Wow, that is way worse
than I thought it was.

39:39.041 --> 39:42.583
-Wait, what did you think it was?
-I don't know. Like, gambling debts or…

39:43.208 --> 39:44.958
You're not gonna tell the others, are you?

39:47.541 --> 39:50.625
No. Like I said, solid as steel.

39:51.250 --> 39:54.166
Besides, we got bigger problems.

39:54.750 --> 39:55.791
Wait, what?

40:10.250 --> 40:12.500
Your money. Now.

40:13.208 --> 40:15.541
Give me your money.

40:16.958 --> 40:17.958
Now.

40:22.208 --> 40:23.250
No.

40:23.333 --> 40:26.250
Give me your money, or I'm gonna kill you!

40:26.750 --> 40:28.375
I swear I will!

40:36.708 --> 40:38.375
All those names.

40:39.208 --> 40:40.375
What?

40:41.333 --> 40:42.458
What are you talking about?

40:42.541 --> 40:45.041
-It should've been me.
-Shut up!

40:45.125 --> 40:47.000
It should've been me that day.

40:47.625 --> 40:49.666
It should've been me that day!

40:51.125 --> 40:52.958
Just give me your money.

40:57.333 --> 40:58.583
I don't want to.

40:59.750 --> 41:01.208
I don't want to…

41:05.000 --> 41:05.916
I'm just…

41:06.833 --> 41:09.333
I'm just so hungry.

41:10.625 --> 41:12.208
I don't wanna kill anyone.

41:14.625 --> 41:15.708
I'm sorry.

41:21.083 --> 41:22.166
It's okay.

41:26.208 --> 41:27.375
It's okay.

41:28.291 --> 41:29.250
Come.

41:30.000 --> 41:30.833
Sit.

41:57.583 --> 41:58.625
Thank you.

42:16.166 --> 42:17.541
Don't let anyone leave.

42:18.333 --> 42:22.583
I know you're here looking for revenge,
but you're looking in the wrong place.

42:22.666 --> 42:24.875
-He lies!
-Keep your eyes on them!

42:25.375 --> 42:28.416
-He's lying. They're hiding the culprit.
-Yeah!

42:28.500 --> 42:30.333
I'm hiding nothing!

42:31.625 --> 42:33.291
I was an officer

42:33.791 --> 42:35.916
ordered to do terrible things.

42:37.333 --> 42:42.375
Men, boys… died under my command.

42:43.375 --> 42:46.208
So I deserted the Fire Nation Army.

42:46.291 --> 42:51.083
An act of treason
that saved your people's lives.

42:52.291 --> 42:53.916
This is lies.

42:54.000 --> 42:55.666
I risked my life

42:56.750 --> 42:57.625
for you.

43:02.666 --> 43:04.958
He's the one who did it!

45:01.750 --> 45:03.041
Fire Nation scum!

45:12.958 --> 45:13.916
Ah!

45:25.291 --> 45:26.250
Katara?

45:29.458 --> 45:32.208
Why are you helping these people?
They're Fire Nation!

45:57.750 --> 46:01.208
The tea shop I work at
is located in the Lower Ring.

46:01.708 --> 46:02.916
You should come by.

46:03.416 --> 46:06.000
Perhaps I can put in a good word for you.

46:06.500 --> 46:10.041
At the very least, you can enjoy
a nice hot cup of jasmine tea.

46:19.833 --> 46:20.833
No.

47:35.125 --> 47:37.875
There are people in this city I can help.

48:04.958 --> 48:07.000
If only I could have helped you,

48:08.791 --> 48:09.833
my son.

48:53.500 --> 48:54.500
Who are you?

48:56.000 --> 48:57.083
Where's Sai?

48:58.750 --> 49:00.083
I know you.

49:00.666 --> 49:03.291
-You're from the Outer Wall.
-Yes, he is.

49:03.375 --> 49:05.083
And we didn't take your friend.

49:06.541 --> 49:07.875
General Sung.

49:07.958 --> 49:13.000
The Dai Li have spies everywhere,
and we needed to talk to you in secret.

49:14.000 --> 49:16.458
It's a great risk for me and my soldiers
to come into the city.

49:16.541 --> 49:18.375
The army controls the Outer Wall.

49:18.458 --> 49:22.166
The Dai Li controls the city,
and they don't want us talking.

49:22.250 --> 49:23.291
Why not?

49:23.375 --> 49:25.333
Because there is
a massive Fire Nation army

49:25.416 --> 49:26.416
assembling out there.

49:26.500 --> 49:27.958
An attack is imminent.

49:28.041 --> 49:31.083
But you said there is no war
in Ba Sing Se.

49:31.166 --> 49:34.083
What did you expect me to say
at the palace?

49:34.166 --> 49:36.875
The party was crawling with Dai Li agents.

49:37.708 --> 49:38.916
This is why…

49:39.541 --> 49:42.208
Look, we don't have long
before your Dai Li handler

49:42.291 --> 49:44.583
launches an extensive search for you.

49:44.666 --> 49:45.875
My handler?

49:46.875 --> 49:47.958
Joo Dee.

49:48.041 --> 49:51.208
You said you have an urgent message
for the Earth King.

49:51.291 --> 49:55.500
I can help you deliver it to him
if you help me rally him to action.

49:56.833 --> 49:58.833
What is it you needed to tell him?

49:59.958 --> 50:04.041
You knocked me out and kidnapped me.
How can I trust you?

50:05.625 --> 50:09.000
The leader of the Kyoshi Warriors, Suki,

50:09.083 --> 50:11.333
told me something
when I asked for her help.

50:11.416 --> 50:14.250
Words you said to her a long time ago.

50:15.291 --> 50:18.750
That where you're from,
people helped each other.

50:20.416 --> 50:23.166
That is the world we want to bring back.

50:30.833 --> 50:32.875
The Great Comet's on its way back.

50:32.958 --> 50:35.625
The comet
that gives Firebenders extreme power.

50:35.708 --> 50:39.416
It's how they were able to wipe out
the Air Nomads a hundred years ago.

50:40.875 --> 50:42.333
Do you know when it will arrive?

50:42.416 --> 50:45.583
That's why I followed your lieutenant.
I thought he was Dai Li.

50:45.666 --> 50:48.625
They locked up
the one person who has proof, Sai.

50:48.708 --> 50:51.458
Long Feng has been
the only one helping us to find him.

50:51.541 --> 50:52.875
Long Feng?

50:53.416 --> 50:55.291
He's been our strongest ally in the city.

50:55.375 --> 50:57.500
He's helping us try
and get around the Dai Li.

50:57.583 --> 50:58.416
Aang.

50:59.291 --> 51:01.166
Long Feng is the Dai Li.

51:05.291 --> 51:09.083
No, that's not true.
The Dai Li are the king's guards.

51:09.166 --> 51:13.500
Operating under Long Feng's command.
He and only he controls the Dai Li.

51:13.583 --> 51:15.500
You cannot trust him.

51:16.000 --> 51:19.625
No! You're wrong. Long Feng is my friend.

51:21.625 --> 51:24.250
Has Long Feng ever let you
meet with the king?

51:26.541 --> 51:27.750
This was a mistake.

51:28.250 --> 51:29.583
Avatar, wait!

51:40.750 --> 51:42.291
I need to see the Earth King.

51:43.750 --> 51:46.125
I demand to see the Earth King right now!

51:46.625 --> 51:47.500
Aang.

51:48.375 --> 51:49.916
What a surprise.

51:50.000 --> 51:51.750
I wanna see the Earth King.

51:51.833 --> 51:54.625
Like I told you,
it is easier said than done.

51:54.708 --> 51:57.166
There's the Fire Nation army
just beyond the wall.

51:57.250 --> 51:58.291
Did you know?

51:58.875 --> 52:01.291
We are quite safe from any army here.

52:01.375 --> 52:02.916
You should know that by now.

52:05.750 --> 52:08.541
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

52:09.875 --> 52:10.791
It's late.

52:10.875 --> 52:13.333
Why don't I ask Joo Dee
to escort you home?

52:13.916 --> 52:15.291
I'll see you in the morning.

52:17.708 --> 52:18.583
Who are you?

52:19.875 --> 52:21.208
I'm Joo Dee.

52:25.125 --> 52:26.125
No, thank you.

52:26.666 --> 52:27.875
I'll see myself out.

52:29.833 --> 52:31.041
Have a good night, Aang.

52:31.125 --> 52:33.666
And remember, you and I,

52:34.333 --> 52:35.833
we're in this together.

52:48.375 --> 52:49.416
Where'd you go?

52:50.291 --> 52:52.750
Aang. I have to tell you something.

52:52.833 --> 52:55.083
Joo Dee came running in
five seconds after I left.

52:55.166 --> 52:56.583
Almost blew the whole thing.

52:56.666 --> 52:58.333
-I'm sorry.
-It's fine.

52:58.416 --> 53:01.375
I didn't even need you. I… dealt with it.

53:02.708 --> 53:03.916
I said I'm sorry. I…

53:07.166 --> 53:08.250
What's going on?

53:09.583 --> 53:11.291
Did you find who was following you?

53:11.375 --> 53:12.541
Yeah.

53:13.333 --> 53:14.375
I did.

53:14.458 --> 53:18.083
And, guys, we're in big trouble.

54:01.666 --> 54:04.416
You don't have to worry
about that Fire Nation army any longer.

54:07.083 --> 54:08.583
This is their general.

54:09.125 --> 54:11.583
He resisted, but he was no match.

54:18.791 --> 54:22.791
We welcome the renowned Kyoshi Warriors
back to Ba Sing Se.
